<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="description" content="Login PURABAYA GO."><title>Login | PURABAYA GO</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<?= base_url('css/home.css') ?>"><style>.auth-page{min-height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#092c45,#0d6287);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.auth-shell{width:min(920px,100%);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:#fff;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}.auth-brand{padding:48px;background:#092c45;color:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.auth-brand h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem);margin:14px 0}.auth-brand p{color:#c9dce5;line-height:1.7}.auth-form{padding:42px}.auth-form h2{margin:0;color:#092c45;font-size:2rem}.auth-subtitle{color:#687e89;line-height:1.6}.auth-form label{display:block;margin:18px 0 7px;color:#274b5d;font-weight:800;font-size:.88rem}.auth-form input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:13px;border:1px solid #d7e1e6;border-radius:10px;font:inherit}.auth-form button{width:100%;margin-top:22px;padding:13px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#f2a62b;color:#092c45;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.alert{padding:11px 13px;border-radius:9px;margin:12px 0}.alert.error{background:#fff0e3;color:#875019;border:1px solid #f4c78d}.alert.success{background:#e4f5ea;color:#21623a;border:1px solid #b9dfc5}.auth-meta{text-align:center;color:#687e89;margin-top:20px}.auth-meta a{color:#0b6389;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:680px){.auth-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.auth-brand{padding:30px}.auth-form{padding:30px}}
</style></head><body><main class="auth-page"><div class="auth-shell"><section class="auth-brand"><span class="eyebrow">PURABAYA GO</span><h1>Informasi perjalanan dari Purabaya.</h1><p>Login untuk melanjutkan akses ke area pengguna. Untuk mencari bus, tujuan, shelter, tarif, dan jadwal, kamu tetap dapat menggunakan portal tanpa melakukan booking.</p></section><section class="auth-form"><h2>Selamat datang</h2><p class="auth-subtitle">Masuk ke akun PURABAYA GO.</p><?php if (session()->getFlashdata('error')): ?><div class="alert error"><?= esc(session()->getFlashdata('error')) ?></div><?php endif; ?><?php if (session()->getFlashdata('success')): ?><div class="alert success"><?= esc(session()->getFlashdata('success')) ?></div><?php endif; ?><?= form_open('/login') ?><label for="identity">Username atau Email</label><input type="text" name="identity" id="identity" value="<?= old('identity') ?? '' ?>" autocomplete="username" required><label for="password">Password</label><input type="password" name="password" id="password" autocomplete="current-password" required><button type="submit">Login</button><?= form_close() ?><div class="auth-meta"><p>Belum punya akun? <a href="<?= site_url('register') ?>">Daftar sekarang</a></p><p><a href="<?= site_url('/') ?>">&larr; Kembali ke Home</a></p></div></section></div></main></body></html>
